  "afternoon-nap-after-3pm-or-over-30-min": "Read from the wearable where it detects naps. Naps after 3pm or over 30 min on 3+ days a week → Tier 1. Otherwise not a hypothesis.",
  "air-purifier-bedroom": "off or unplugged for 30 days → Tier 2 (not being used). Allergies or heavy traffic → expected effect 0.7. Otherwise Tier 3.",
  "alcohol-in-the-evening": "0 → not in the inventory. 1 to 2 → Tier 1, observe-only, expected effect 1.5 but fewer on-nights, so the test runs over 3 to 4 weeks. 3 or more → Tier 1, observe-only, two weeks is enough.",
  "ashwagandha-ksm-66-sensoril": "form = plain root powder under 1 g, or extract under 250 mg → Tier 2 (dose too low). Otherwise Tier 1, queued (slow).",
  "bedroom-temperature-thermostat": "Room over 21°C or wakes hot → expected effect 1.0, Tier 1. Otherwise Tier 3 (effect too small, can run anyway).",
  "berberine": "dose under 1 g a day → Tier 2 (dose too low). Any medication, diabetes, or prediabetes → Protected.",
  "beta-alanine": "dose under 2 g a day → Tier 2 (dose too low). Otherwise Tier 3, with the 1-to-4-minute note.",
  "blackout-light-leak": "Tier 3 (effect too small, can run anyway). Overlap with eye mask: if both, keep one.",
  "blood-panel-subscription-function-etc": "Annual physical with bloodwork also in the inventory → Tier 2 (overlaps with something else) unless the subscription tests something the physical doesn't. Overlap group 'bloodwork'.",
