  "cbd": "dose under 25 mg → Tier 2 (dose too low). Otherwise Tier 3 (effect too small, can run anyway). Any medication → Protected.",
  "chiropractor-maintenance-visits": "Visits with no current pain → Tier 3 with the 'maintenance has no evidence' note. Pain → Tier 3 with pain rating.",
  "coffee-after-2pm": "last coffee before noon → not a hypothesis; Tier 3 'not an issue for you'. 12 to 2pm → Tier 1 with a smaller expected effect (0.6, so gated to Tier 3 unless they choose to run it). After 2pm → Tier 1.",
  "cold-plunge-ice-bath": "evening → number = time to fall asleep. Morning → number = overnight HRV. Either way Tier 3 (effect too small, can run anyway); pre-purchase proxy offered.",
